OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead after 'violent
OL,4,Aincidents'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fman following two violent incidents in
OL,8,FPeel.
OL,10,FThe Isle of Man Constabulary said the
OL,11,Ffirst happened near the harbour in Peel
OL,12,Fat about 19:00 GMT on Wednesday. A
OL,13,Fsecond incident took place near the
OL,14,FPeveril pub about an hour later.
OL,16,FOne of the men believed to have been
OL,17,Finvolved in the second incident was
OL,18,Flater found dead at a nearby address.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
