OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead after 'violent
OL,4,Aincidents'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said a man had been charged with
OL,7,Foffences relating to the first
OL,8,Fincident. He has been released on bail
OL,9,Fwhile inquiries into the second
OL,10,Fincident continue.
